|GKB================================ Cook Ash ================================
|GKB=|XX0   Syntax: ccook |YKB<ash>|XX0                                                  |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0                                                                        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   This will allow you to cook the contents of your ash burner in an    |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   acid potion, creating a vial of crystalized ash. You can 'sniff      |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   vial' to use the contents. The more ash you use, the longer the      |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   effects will last. These vials are known to last for fifteen         |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   minutes at best. Though it's never an exact science, some early      |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   users realized they got about a minute out of every 60 ash used.     |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0                                                                        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   There are rumours the first Charlatan to use these vials became      |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   so fragile that a canary did him in! Hopefully those side-effects    |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   are just rumours.                                                    |GKB=
|GKB==========================================================================

